models for a wide range of tasks, such as question answering and language inference, without substantial task- speciﬁc architecture modiﬁcations. BERT is conceptually simple and empirically powerful.', 199, '[-0.047424186,0.04980771,0.0025855948,-0.005884229,-0.084481336,0.036890138,-0.056188345,0.022629205,-0.03246016,-0.09585386,-0.046048626,0.06040279,0.06498811,-0.015037921,0.032526758,-0.053322077,0.0821222,0.0776943,-0.053127643,-0.017490502,0.027768789,-0.0054770326,0.012286182,0.009431203,0.002014291,-0.0037289888,0.013229682,-0.009415508,0.11290991,-0.14150001,0.017368352,0.10871228,-0.008020151,0.006868156,-0.031283885,0.09034958,-0.011604904,0.03961531,-0.06901665,0.058029473,-0.062101908,0.0382656,-0.03490397,-0.03154048,-0.0032421597,-0.055891413,-0.006439271,0.04068762,-0.15506172,-0.033339877,-0.0060322233,-0.005641929,-0.012631641,0.031811826,-0.020393211,-0.022918016,0.07718826,0.046454694,-0.029398056,-0.069930814,-0.040691804,-0.03541328,-0.09869658,0.03832307,0.021283425,0.013351979,0.0061697913,0.015957218,0.015510156,0.05744601,-0.0035433555,-0.007524744,0.009143582,0.028166026,0.09057082,-0.003521786,0.041326694,0.013889443,0.0351507,-0.12513915,0.09787855,-0.050363354,-0.01018826,0.04716735,-0.012746741,0.030397268,-0.008696565,-0.032298252,-0.022554258,-0.011309053,0.073089436,-0.107133724,0.031167818,0.027155768,0.069389954,0.011330713,-0.007204672,0.00088107097,0.019098,0.17616448,-0.014886128,-0.033671066,-0.016803892,0.004137386,0.03929154,-0.058478788,0.02141358,-0.03660936,-0.04014055,-0.03358777,-0.012268198,-0.03507167,-0.029264456,-0.021049263,-0.037791505,-0.08143235,0.034732807,-0.0041091284,0.0029422967,0.022942053,-0.05332659,0.00981959,0.056861013,0.051747195,0.04514462,-0.10601866,-0.058581766,-0.09805946,-0.034365147,-0.047394164,0.10368758,0.024128878,0.022555582,0.02782421,0.0339144,0.0096643055,0.016269557,-0.072961934,0.015943253,0.002900406,-0.040346693,0.070269346,0.04654132,0.08353117,-0.078729,0.0005200731,0.022977449