same pre-trained parameters. The question-answering example in Figure 1 will serve as a running example for this section. A distinctive feature of BERT is its uniﬁed ar- chitecture across different tasks. There is mini- mal difference between the pre-trained architec- ture and the ﬁnal downstream architecture.', 227, '[-0.0053372732,0.09481826,0.006344616,0.0017975474,-0.0035072556,0.010677935,-0.007701404,0.053993296,-0.036900815,-0.07303447,0.028681334,-0.0059288703,0.06541722,-0.0107454145,-0.028480839,-0.042385127,0.041386787,0.071253866,-0.0206325,-0.03932033,0.0011005945,-0.05011019,0.0031416463,-0.0022295518,-0.0074844244,-0.024442738,-0.021598153,-0.013247537,0.11861706,-0.14570326,0.0026399768,0.07465986,0.006540142,0.054816555,-0.030441118,0.07048228,-0.019055182,0.03624277,-0.0717411,0.031237539,0.0088322405,0.01589883,-0.027524585,-0.021184122,-0.0008599972,-0.058142666,-0.053597026,-0.028955113,-0.15315044,-0.06935714,-0.017300127,-0.06420863,0.030952906,0.013119734,0.0010553129,-0.04105791,0.061514784,0.026626786,-0.025077412,-0.026316844,-0.07609027,-0.022825383,-0.12021715,0.012005802,0.020965265,-0.0014544167,0.014657546,0.0002895406,0.0032708037,0.053236436,-0.051234376,0.03624703,-0.00755652,0.0090036,0.015552538,0.013704607,0.03303029,0.07038856,0.0027377568,-0.09423724,0.11971327,-0.015007179,-0.0058616474,0.020529497,0.027894832,0.015851166,-0.013121798,-0.0081956005,-0.013902283,-0.076826796,0.056860063,-0.07780573,0.0040584044,0.044050585,0.046579815,0.011142055,-0.031462315,-0.007663265,0.045915995,0.18009998,-0.04488412,-0.044860765,0.028176641,0.050242227,0.0037401884,-0.041516986,0.014303349,-0.036452405,0.031782843,-0.030001646,-0.03401504,-0.006588623,-0.02455528,-0.0513201,0.004161925,-0.1069993,-0.0036442194,0.040619638,0.035272036,0.03959634,0.023807934,-0.004849461,0.04315071,0.0024267924,0.09798223,-0.0777863,-0.06885569,-0.063053645,0.0013634792,-0.03460869,0.07358311,-0.008634704,0.015156752,0.02279065,0.011356089,0.0060389484,0.