random replacement only occurs for 1.5% of all tokens (i.e., 10% of 15%), this does not seem to harm the model’s language understanding capability. In Section C.2, we evaluate the impact this proce- dure. Compared to standard langauge model training, the masked LM only make predictions on 15% of tokens in each batch, which suggests that more pre-training steps may be required for the model BERT (Ours) Trm Trm Trm Trm Trm Trm ... ... Trm Trm Trm Trm Trm Trm ... ... OpenAI GPT Lstm ELMo Lstm Lstm Lstm
