INSERT INTO "DocumentChunk" ("id", "workspaceId", "documentId", "heading", "content", "tokens", "embedding", "kind", "createdAt", "contextPrefix", "chunkType", "ordinal", "pageStart", "pageEnd", "chapter", "section", "subsection", "sectionPath", "sourceElementIds", "parentChunkId", "previousChunkId", "nextChunkId", "characterCount", "oversized", "contentHash", "parserVersion", "chunkerVersion", "embeddingModelVersion", "schemaVersion", "tokenEstimatorVersion", "embeddingDimensions", "indexVersion") VALUES ('chk-2df36b2a03dd6394c66b733e', 'gans-goodfellow-2014', 'doc_gans_2014', 'Generative Adversarial Nets > 2 Adversarial Framework', '## 2 Adversarial Framework

The adversarial modeling framework is most straightforward to apply when the models are both multilayer perceptrons. To learn the generator''s distribution $p_g$ over data $x$, we define a prior on input noise variables $p_z(z)$, then represent a mapping to data space as $G(z; \\theta_g)$, where $G$ is a differentiable function represented by a multilayer perceptron with parameters $\\theta_g$. We also define a second multilayer perceptron $D(x; \\theta_d)$ that outputs a single scalar. $D(x)$ represents the probability that $x$ came from the data rather than $p_g$.\\n\\nWe train $D$ to maximize the probability of assigning the correct label to both training examples and samples from $G$. We simultaneously train $G$ to minimize $\\log(1 - D(G(z)))$.', 217, '[0.0062046885,0.041261375,-0.030169126,0.022358323,-0.01538932,-8.57271e-05,0.030152354,0.017561968,-0.044838715,-0.010700507,0.05617249,-0.028201247,0.037914596,-0.008435725,-0.0033937856,-0.0073402193,-0.0014859036,0.008413798,-0.11913548,-0.026280986,0.042002194,-0.047372703,-0.06228797,0.01793799,-0.020006731,0.026482906,-0.014183097,-0.014335948,0.055809554,-0.062867,0.047463235,0.088849336,-0.0024997685,0.0043450994,-0.005791179,0.055527937,0.03676673,0.050788403,-0.056152232,0.08348317,-0.038785882,0.04274709,-0.038373556,-0.016143158,-0.004798384,-0.10641485,-0.049796738,-0.036220588,-0.13252752,-0.09149545,-0.03713886,-0.085591674,-0.03250413,-0.04307677,-0.061608884,-0.007497188,0.070447125,-0.01818619,-0.042483103,-0.046269834,-0.06372614,-0.024861129,-0.06170723,0.017212136,0.027889147,-0.0004122755,0.07590951,0.051168114,0.043064088,0.10522514,-0.0011174942,-0.009738625,-0.06868585,-0.06383341,-0.0030942943,0.05233745,0.02424059,0.008378323,0.12567702,-0.0669746,0.11214842,-0.010693559,-0.035194006,-0.03225739,-0.051923025,0.034997944,0.043984562,-0.042608652,0.041030727,-0.065967,0.046126653,0.013331789,-0.052350976,0.052580185,0.00040738613,0.022856884,-0.01235385,-0.02493988,0.073465586,0.1492529,