INSERT INTO "DocumentChunk" ("id", "workspaceId", "documentId", "heading", "content", "tokens", "embedding", "kind", "createdAt", "contextPrefix", "chunkType", "ordinal", "pageStart", "pageEnd", "chapter", "section", "subsection", "sectionPath", "sourceElementIds", "parentChunkId", "previousChunkId", "nextChunkId", "characterCount", "oversized", "contentHash", "parserVersion", "chunkerVersion", "embeddingModelVersion", "schemaVersion", "tokenEstimatorVersion", "embeddingDimensions", "indexVersion") VALUES ('chk-a9c0d33c82225b1dbbfd62ae', 'gans-goodfellow-2014', 'doc_gans_2014', 'Generative Adversarial Nets > Extended Technical Details > The Minimax Value Objective', '### The Minimax Value Objective

The generator and discriminator compete to optimize the value function $V(D, G)$:

- **Optimal Discriminator:** For any fixed $G$, optimal discriminator is $D^*_G(x) = \\frac{p_{\\text{data}}(x)}{p_{\\text{data}}(x) + p_g(x)}$.
- **Global Minimum:** Achieved if and only if $p_g = p_{\\text{data}}$, where $V(D^*, G) = -\\log 4$.

