INSERT INTO "DocumentChunk" ("id", "workspaceId", "documentId", "heading", "content", "tokens", "embedding", "kind", "createdAt", "contextPrefix", "chunkType", "ordinal", "pageStart", "pageEnd", "chapter", "section", "subsection", "sectionPath", "sourceElementIds", "parentChunkId", "previousChunkId", "nextChunkId", "characterCount", "oversized", "contentHash", "parserVersion", "chunkerVersion", "embeddingModelVersion", "schemaVersion", "tokenEstimatorVersion", "embeddingDimensions", "indexVersion") VALUES ('chk-fb3adac70097210805278de7', 'resnet-deep-residual-learning', 'doc_resnet_2015', 'Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition > Extended Technical Details > Residual Learning Formulation', '### Residual Learning Formulation

Instead of hoping stacked layers fit $\\mathcal{H}(x)$, we let them approximate a residual mapping:

- **Identity Shortcuts:** Shortcuts introduce neither extra parameters nor computational complexity ($O(1)$ additions).
- **Optimization Ease:** Solvers simply drive weights of multiple layers toward zero to achieve identity mappings.

