000+ citations. Goodfellow named GAN inventor by MIT Tech Review."}],"title":"Compile failed — applied 1 autofix patch, retrying","detail":"Interrupted","status":"error","undoMany":[{"cardId":"card_mua48xi5_8wxag","content":"Spawned an entire research ecosystem:\\n\\n- **DCGAN** (2015) — deep convolutional GANs\\n- **WGAN** (2017) — Wasserstein distance, stable training\\n- **ProGAN** (2018) — progressive growing, 1024×1024 faces\\n- **StyleGAN** (2019/2021) — style-based generator, photorealistic\\n- **BigGAN** (2018) — class-conditional at scale\\n- **CycleGAN** (2017) — unpaired image translation\\n- **pix2pix** — conditional image-to-image\\n\\n📄 60,000+ citations. Goodfellow named GAN inventor by MIT Tech Review."}],"createdAt":1789929683896,"fixesApplied":true},{"id":"9ac69a69-6129-49a7-a6fe-5d5097f20019","ts":"09:21:25 PM","kind":"info","title":"Workspace loaded","detail":"5 cards · betterposter","status":"done","createdAt":1789932085571},{"id":"e5fd33b0-b008-4502-a428-56864eb32260","ts":"09:21:29 PM","kind":"generate","title":"Compile succeeded","detail":"Cached preview ready.","status":"done","createdAt":1789932089182},{"id":"831d8e42-4b79-4db8-a7c1-58dda037fff7","ts":"09:21:29 PM","kind":"review","tips":[{"issue":"Broken figure in Slot 1: file \\"fig_gan_arch.png\\" is missing from assets.","cardId":"card_mua48xi3_w8zve","message":"Broken figure in Slot 1: file \\"fig_gan_arch.png\\" is missing from assets. — Use AI Fix to reconnect matching asset or re-upload figure.","category":"Card: Architecture & Training","severity":"warning","recommendation":"Use AI Fix to reconnect matching asset or re-upload figure."}],"title":"Layout Inspection","detail":"1 layout issue detected","status":"done","createdAt":1789932089964},{"id":"be7db130-041e-42f7-a770-7701d1f78232","ts":"11:37:14 PM","kind":"info","title":"Workspace loaded","detail":"8 cards · gemini","status":"done","createdAt":1789940234162},{"id":"6ebbe89a-a8b4-42e1-bfe2-5da4849a8482","ts":"11:37:16 PM","kind